{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/news/melanie-ward-appointed-parliamentary-under-secretary-of-state","content_id":"812ec283-f09c-42c5-8d77-45c2144380f0","description":"Melanie Ward appointed Parliamentary Under-Secretary of State in the Scotland Office.","details":{"attachments":[],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><h3 id=\"uk-government-minister-for-scotland-melanie-ward-said\">UK Government Minister for Scotland Melanie Ward said:</h3>\n\n<blockquote>\n  <p>I am honoured to serve in Prime Minister Andy Burnham’s new government and to be part of putting Scotland at the centre of the positive change that lies ahead.</p>\n\n  <p>People are going to be at the heart of everything we do – from helping to ease the cost of living, to generating growth that will create new jobs, to pushing power out into communities. </p>\n\n  <p class=\"last-child\">Scotland has an abundance of talent and opportunities and I look forward to working with Secretary of State Douglas Alexander to deliver for our people.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-27T13:25:38Z"}],"emphasised_organisations":["63953ed9-98ac-4d08-a1b9-8ea38dbd0832"],"images":[{"caption":"","content_type":"image/jpeg","sources":{"s216":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a64af64e2d191f0bc8b6f05/s216_Min_Ward_headshot__resize_.jpg","s300":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a64af642dc18ebe4c3b2beb/s300_Min_Ward_headshot__resize_.jpg","s465":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a64af64abcde513b38b6ebc/s465_Min_Ward_headshot__resize_.jpg","s630":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a64af64abcde513b38b6ebd/s630_Min_Ward_headshot__resize_.jpg","s712":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a64af64abcde513b38b6ebf/s712_Min_Ward_headshot__resize_.jpg","s960":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a64af642dc18ebe4c3b2bec/s960_Min_Ward_headshot__resize_.jpg"},"type":"lead"}],"poli